      "content": "<p></p><p><b>Infrastructure Development</b></p><p>Hennur has undergone huge infrastructure development in the past few years. This growth improved living standards and made it a beautiful place for families.</p><h4><b><br>Residential Projects</b></h4><p>Residential complexes are plenty here, ranging from small affordable apartments to luxurious villas.</p><h4><b><br>Commercial Growth</b></h4><p>&nbsp;This place also has multiple shopping malls and commercial outlets available in the area</p><p><b>Shopping Malls:<a href=\"https://elementsmall.com/\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp;Elements Mall </a></b>is one of the biggest and popular shopping destinations here.<br><b>Local Markets:</b> Many hypermarkets satisfy day-to-day requirements.</p><p><b><br></b></p><h4><b>Hennur Road</b></h4>There is huge promise even from the development work. There is an IT Investment Region (ITIR) that is coming right above the airport and on top of it, in the same region, the aerospace SEZ is equally in good books. Owing to these employment corners Hennur Road offers its close proximity. Housing demand might again jump through the roof here.<br><br><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Real Estate Market Analysis</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocgjzoe2dvahd9\",\"id\":\"toc_hpy1qymg3i61\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_hpy1qymg3i61\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocgjzoe2dvahd9\",\"id\":\"toc_hpy1qymg3i61\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_hpy1qymg3i61\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><p data-header=\"2\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading2\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"18pt\" data-hd-info=\"2\" data-line-height=\"1.6\" style=