      "content": "<h2><b>Recreational Amenities</b></h2><p>Living in Hennur can provide many recreational facilities. This is enhancing the overall quality of life.</p><h4><b>Parks and Green Spaces</b></h4><p>Hennur is known for its green surroundings:</p><p><b>Hennur Lake Park:</b> an ideal spot for relaxation along with outdoor games.<br><b>Kuvempu Park:</b> With walking trails and children playgrounds.<br></p><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Community Spaces</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toces344a6f4hi8\",\"id\":\"toc_5yb8c6tvwyl6\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_5yb8c6tvwyl6\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toces344a6f4hi8\",\"id\":\"toc_5yb8c6tvwyl6\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_5yb8c6tvwyl6\"> </span></b></h2><p data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" class=\"zw-paragraph\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The locality itself conducts community activities that encourage one to interact more with other society members. These events typically encompass festivals, fairs, and cultural programs.</span></p><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Safety and Security</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toca0qooiing8gj\",\"id\":\"toc_j0lyneanb9